# The Learjet 35A's sounds, synthesised (src/audio/sound_set.hpp says each line).
# Placeholders until Phase 15's recordings: every figure below but her
# engines' cylinders is a stand-in, chosen to sound like her kind of
# aeroplane, not taken from a source.

# Two Garrett TFE731-2s, their fans geared.
# Her fan's speed at 100% N1 and its blades are stand-ins; her note
# follows the flight model's N1.
engine turbine 10000 30 0.28
wind 0.15 230
gear 400 0.06
flaps 600 0.05
touchdown 0.40
stall-warning 13 700 0.10
# Another aircraft's engine is heard at about her cruise N1 percent.
heard-as-other 85
